# NekoDevOS Package List - OPTIMIZED FOR PERFORMANCE
# Minimal packages for a fast, lightweight developer OS

# ============================================================================
# CORE SYSTEM PACKAGES
# ============================================================================
ubuntu-minimal
casper
discover
laptop-detect
network-manager
grub-common
grub-pc-bin
grub2-common
locales
linux-generic

# ============================================================================
# DESKTOP ENVIRONMENT - XFCE (Minimal)
# ============================================================================
xfce4
xfce4-terminal
lightdm
lightdm-gtk-greeter

# ============================================================================
# DISPLAY SERVER
# ============================================================================
xserver-xorg-core
xserver-xorg-input-all

# ============================================================================
# ESSENTIAL DEVELOPMENT TOOLS
# ============================================================================
git
vim
python3
python3-pip
build-essential

# ============================================================================
# SYSTEM UTILITIES
# ============================================================================
thunar
htop
neofetch

# Archive Tools
unzip
zip

# ============================================================================
# NETWORKING & INTERNET
# ============================================================================
firefox
wget
curl

# ============================================================================
# FONTS
# ============================================================================
fonts-noto
fonts-noto-cjk

# ============================================================================
# NOTES
# ============================================================================
# Removed bloat packages:
# - ubuntu-standard (adds many unnecessary services)
# - xfce4-goodies (games and extra apps)
# - Multiple terminals (kept only xfce4-terminal)
# - Multiple file managers (kept only thunar)
# - Heavy IDEs and apps
# - Gaming packages (steam, lutris, wine)
# - Office suites (libreoffice)
# - Multiple browsers (kept only firefox)
# - Communication apps (discord, telegram)
# - Multimedia editors (gimp, inkscape, krita)
# - Video recording tools
# - Docker/containers (install manually if needed)
# - Database clients
# - Multiple programming languages (install as needed)
# - Theme packs and customization tools
# - preload, timeshift and heavy background services
#
# Users can install additional tools after boot using apt
